  "abstract": "Isolate stability effect by reducing a_max from 0.995 to 0.993 in the LN variant (k=320, p=32, H=96, \u03b3_end=0.99). Keeps Adam optimizer, residual copy, MAE+temporal curvature, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
